{
  "id": 513,
  "title": "智慧建筑——?未来的方向",
  "date": "2023-12-20",
  "summary": "城市基础设施是城市经济发展和社会发展必不可少的硬件，为城市发展提供了保障。通过根据实际情况和用户需求，对建筑结构、系统、服务和管理进行优化组合，从而高效地为用户定制、舒适、方便的人性化建筑环境——让智能建筑理念领先，实现绿色生活、智能医疗、人工智能、高科技产业园区愿景，让智能建筑领先或成为增加城市承载力、开启未来之门的关键。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-513.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-4/202274145142621.jpg",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  城市基础设施是城市经济发展和社会发展必不可少的硬件，为城市发展提供了保障。通过根据实际情况和用户需求，对建筑结构、系统、服务和管理进行优化组合，从而高效地为用户定制、舒适、方便的人性化建筑环境——让智能建筑理念领先，实现绿色生活、智能医疗、人工智能、高科技产业园区愿景，让智能建筑领先或成为增加城市承载力、开启未来之门的关键。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><strong><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">建立互动智慧医疗</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><b><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;\" /></b></span><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  突破传统医疗的局限性，确保远程医疗系统、互联网系统、在线分机处理系统、医院信息系统和业务处理系统能够有效连接，从而提高医院自身资源的利用价值，为公园内的人们提供精准优质的服务。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  设计更侧重于物联网感知、网络通信、计算与存储、数据与服务融合(数据资源与应用支持服务、系统接口等)的基础设施建设。).</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  通过视频监控、红外感应等。，可以提高医疗信息传递的及时性，并利用物联网技术无线远程控制和操作各种医疗设备。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  智慧医疗的核心是利用先进的物联网技术，在公园内搭建健康档案区域医疗信息平台，实现患者与医务人员、医疗机构、医疗设备的互动。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">集约型、资源共享和适度提前是城市建筑在智慧城市下应有的建设和发展意识。在保证业态复合、多元化平台、完善配套设施的前提下，给空间更多的变化。合理的规划、有机的联系、智能的可变性和成长使公园更加高效和充满活力。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  从而创造整体，生态“绿动”、一个世界级的智能医疗产业园区，智慧，J具有未来感。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><strong><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">未来的建筑需求「绿色智慧」</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  智慧城市高度重视资源能源的高效利用和环境污染问题，智慧型建筑正朝着绿色生态的方向发展。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  建筑的朝向、体型、结构设计和节能技术因地制宜。增加可再生新能源的使用，提高自然光和自然风的使用效率。可再生和可降解材料是建筑材料的首选。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  大力推进标准化建筑建设的发展和应用。预制建筑在建设效率、质量管理和绿色环保方面非常适合智慧城市建设中的生态和可持续发展理念。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  倡导山水诗意的绿色生活，取山水之美，营造流动的生态环境，营造“山水生活”的生态空间意境，营造公园购物体验，营造生态办公和绿色生活休闲空间。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  园区生态低碳化实现了“大面积绿化、绿色办公环境、员工有机餐饮”。“大数据管理、智能服务、低碳技术应用”实现了园区科技的智能化。 </span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  利用先锋科学打造融合交通站、核心商业区、办公区、开放空间、居住区、次级区的TOD开发模式，以“智能”创新城核心区的优势吸引著名企业筑巢，实现桃浦“智能创新”的发展转型。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  “智能停车系统”驱车到办公楼下，将车交给智能停车系统，自动停车进入车库。通过APP预约，停车和取车可以在一分半钟内完成。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><strong><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">人工智能-从智慧园区开始</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  作为新一轮科技革命和产业变革的重要动力，人工智能的发展紧迫性影响了我国科技产业变革的机遇。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  智能化经济模式是：物联网+人工智能+适应性服务，“智能建筑”就是其中的一部分。而且人工智能已成为智能建筑模式的重要组成部分。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  在机遇下，如何高标准地发展人工智能所需的跨境融合环境成为关键。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  智能化工业园区包括数据收集、商业系统应用、管理平台和综合应用尾端。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  园区建设以先进的云计算大数据、物联网、人工智能等技术为基础，构建业务数字化、系统全连接、数据全整合的数字化园区综合体系。建成后，整个园区的物体、资源和流程可视化、可控化、可控化，通过智能操作系统实现。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  人工智能与智能建筑的结合充分展示了跨境融合的特点。在以创新和创业为重点的新理论和技术驱动下，G端绿色生态的创新环境建设满足了未来发展的需要。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  智慧建筑以产业为保障，推动城市更新和完善服务设施，进一步提升土地价值，为产业与城市融合发展的“产城融合”理念提供了基础。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;\" /></span><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  作为“产城融合”的先行者，智慧建筑和智慧园区是区域经济发展的新引擎，是智慧元素的集聚区，将为城市产业和人文活力提供持续向上的单元支撑。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">  在新时代背景中蕴含的机遇和挑战下，智慧建筑与智慧园区建设发展的愿景能否实现，离不开对智慧城市建设的政策支持、对智慧城市规划的理论指导、建筑创新技术研发和应急与发展管理体系中成套技术产品储备的共同支持。</span><br /></p>",
